1. [... barag] mah-a dur₂ ŋar-ra
#lem: X; barag[sanctum]; mah[great]; dur[buttocks]; ŋar[put]
#tr.en: …… who has taken her seat on an exalted dais, 
#etcsl: line-id=1

2. [... ni₂] gur₃#-ru u₆ di-de₃ gub-ba
#lem: X; ni[fear]; gur[lift]; u[admiration]; di[speak]; gub[stand]
#tr.en: ……, imbued with awesomeness, an amazing sight, 
#etcsl: line-id=2

3. [...] {[d]}[nin-isin₂]{si#}-na hu-ul-hu-le-eš₂ sig₇-ga
#lem: X; Ninisinak[1]DN; hul[rejoice]; sissig[green-yellow]
#tr.en: …… @wDN{Ninisina}, joyously fresh, ……, 
#etcsl: line-id=3

4. [... me] ur₄-ur₄ ŋarza₂ im-pad₃-de₃
#lem: X; me[Being]; ur[gather]; ŋarza[rites]; pad[find]
#tr.en: gathering up the divine powers, she announces the rites. 
#etcsl: line-id=4

5. X {[d]}[nin]-isin₂{[si]}-na-ke₄ nam-galam-ma gu₂ nam-mi-in-KU
#lem: X; Ninisinak[1]DN; namgalam[skillfullness]; gu[neck]; X
#tr.en: …… @wDN{Ninisina} …… with intricate skill. 
#etcsl: line-id=5

6. [...] nam-galam-ma u₂-a me na-ur₄-ur₄-re
#lem: X; namgalam[skillfullness]; ua[provisioner]; me[Being]; ur[gather]
#tr.en: ……, ministering with intricate skill, she gathers up the divine powers; 
#etcsl: line-id=6

7. {[d]}nin-isin₂{si}-na-ke₄ nam-galam-ma u₂-a me na-ur₄-ur₄-re
#lem: Ninisinak[1]DN; namgalam[skillfullness]; ua[provisioner]; me[Being]; ur[gather]
#tr.en: @wDN{Ninisina}, ministering with intricate skill, she gathers up the divine powers. 
#etcsl: line-id=7

8. me mah šu-še₃ na-ŋa₂-ŋa₂-ŋa₂
#lem: me[Being]; mah[great]; šu[hand]; ŋar[put]
#tr.en: She takes in her hands the august divine powers. 
#etcsl: line-id=8

9. tug₂ gal-e u-gun₃ im-ma-ak-e inim im-ma-ab-sag₉-ge
#lem: tug[textile]; gal[big]; ugunu[decoration]; ak[do]; inim[word]; sag[good]
#tr.en: She attaches the incrustations to the great garment, while speaking favourable words. 
#etcsl: line-id=9

10. bulug-kiŋ₂-gur₄-ra igi mu-un-sig₁₀-ge
#lem: bulug.KIN.gur₄[lancet]; igi[eye]; sig[put into]
#tr.en: She tests the surgical lancet; @wDN{Ninisina} sharpens the scalpel. 
#etcsl: line-id=10

11. {d}nin-isin₂{si}-na-ke₄ ŋiri₂-GAG-e u₃-sar im-ma-ak-e
#lem: Ninisinak[1]DN; ŋirizal[scalpel]; usar[cvne]; ak[do]
#tr.en: She has made perfect the divine powers of medicine, 
#etcsl: line-id=11

